OL,3,GNEWSASame-sex pairing is important,
OL,4,AStrictly star says
OL,5,
OL,6,FActress Bethany Antonia has spoken
OL,7,Fabout the importance of representation
OL,8,Fafter she was placed in a same-sex
OL,9,Fpairing with a professional dancer in
OL,10,Fthis year's Strictly Come Dancing.
OL,12,FThe Birmingham-born star, who began her
OL,13,Ftelevision career playing Jada Conjo in
OL,14,FBBC soap Doctors at the age of 18, said
OL,15,Ftaking part in the dance competition
OL,16,Fwith partner Nancy Xu was a surreal
OL,17,Fexperience.
OL,19,FSeeing previous same-sex pairings on
OL,20,Fthe televised dancing competition had
OL,21,Fhelped her feel more comfortable being
OL,22,Fout to people in her life.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
